{"reviewId": "11802639_85pFfwqXr", "review": {"bookId": "3300128305", "content": "2016年是熊市第七年探低反弹，那么熊市周期开始就是在2009年，经过15-20年开启下一个牛市周期，就是2024-2029年左右开启大宗商品牛市", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "range": "5504-5580", "abstract": "2020年之后也不意味着商品牛市的开启，要经历15～20年的震荡市之后才有新的产能周期，即大宗商品牛市的出现，所以，人生大概率只能碰到一次大宗商品牛市。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 22, "chapterName": "17 采访合集", "chapterIdx": 22, "reviewId": "11802639_85pFfwqXr", "userVid": 11802639, "topics": [], "createTime": 1765786714, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "17 采访合集", "author": {"userVid": 11802639, "name": "洲（我是镜子）", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/PiajxSqBRaEJRLWIial0HJ3UMp0KXI7ccwXeWGiaN6PGewUpGZJYZySfYene4kwGLhg15eKFr7YbHWhqubFQyvlLEnv1EVUnw5rmz7aruJIickBcExjEGE7rAA/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M13-20250203-25", "desc": "每周阅读挑战", "title": "狂暴阅读周", "levelIndex": 25}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 18, "likes": [{"userVid": 445523251, "name": "nice", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/II4atMdsz0cvc3qibOdEOricNicricBMoiaFIXbSCvQUkRp7CLjuTiajq5TbEqenvvBVg1iaeGZibXlkSF0/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": ""}], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "准的。黄金最大周期是2022-2026", "reviewId": "11802639_85pFfwqXr", "commentId": "11802639_85pFfwqXr_c89151317_8c7VQpuBV", "userVid": 89151317, "createTime": 1789430815, "author": {"userVid": 8915131